accessibility:
{'info': 'Accessibility customers should buy a Weekend Camping, Weekend Non-Camping, or relevant Day Ticket. Please note there is no separate Accessibility ticket type. 

Full information about the accessible facilities available at the event (including Essential Companion tickets), and how to apply for them, can be found on the State Fayre Accessibility Information page (opens in new tab).

If you wish to stay in a Campervan/Caravan in the Accessibility Campsite, please do not buy a standard Campervan/Caravan Ticket or Pitch as this will not be transferable to the Accessibility Campsite. You will be able to apply for an Accessibility Campervan pass as part of your application to use the accessible facilities.', 'url': 'https://www.statefayre.com/information/accessibility', 'urlText': 'State Fayre Accessibility Information page'}
